---
// Preview page — dev preview of hero design
// Review at /preview before deploying to homepage
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>EngageEngine™ — Hero Preview</title>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <a href="/" class="logo">EngageEngine<sup>™</sup></a>
  <a href="/diagnostic/" class="nav-cta">Take the Diagnostic →</a>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">DEMAND COLLAPSE DIAGNOSTIC</p>
  <h1>Your Revenue Doesn't Match<br>Your <em>Reputation.</em></h1>
  <p class="lead">
    That's not a marketing problem. It's a <strong>comparison control problem</strong> — and it's costing businesses like yours an average of $328,000 a year in deals that were already won.
  </p>
  <p class="mechanism">
    If prospects trust you, like you, and still ask for another quote — something specific is breaking down in the window between "I believe you" and "I'm choosing you." The failure mode has a name, a documented mechanism, and a fix that doesn't require spending more on marketing.
  </p>
  <div class="cta-block">
    <a href="/diagnostic/" class="btn-primary">
      Take the Demand Collapse Diagnostic
      <span class="arrow">→</span>
    </a>
    <span class="cta-sub">Twelve questions. Ten minutes. No sales call.</span>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="stat-strip">
  <div class="stat">
    <span class="stat-num">$328K</span>
    <span class="stat-label">avg. annual revenue leak</span>
  </div>
  <div class="stat">
    <span class="stat-num">4</span>
    <span class="stat-label">documented failure modes</span>
  </div>
  <div class="stat">
    <span class="stat-num">36%</span>
    <span class="stat-label">of businesses fail here</span>
  </div>
  <div class="stat">
    <span class="stat-num">23+</span>
    <span class="stat-label">retainer clients diagnosed</span>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>

<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  :root {
    --canvas: #f5f5f7;
    --graphite: #1d1d1f;
    --mid-gray: #6e6e73;
    --light-gray: #aeaeb2;
    --blue: #0071e3;
    --border: #d6d6d6;
  }
  body {
    background: var(--canvas);
    color: var(--graphite);
    font-family: -apple-system, 'SF Pro Text', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  /* NAV */
  nav {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0 32px;
    height: 52px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
    backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
  }
  .logo {
    font-family: -apple-system, 'SF Pro Display', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--graphite);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .logo sup {
    font-size: 9px;
    vertical-align: super;
    color: var(--blue);
  }
  .nav-cta {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--blue);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .nav-cta:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  /* HERO */
  .hero {
    padding: 72px 32px 64px;
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--blue);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: -apple-system, 'SF Pro Display', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 56px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.07;
    color: var(--graphite);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }
  h1 em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--blue);
  }
  .lead {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--mid-gray);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    max-width: 580px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .lead strong {
    color: var(--graphite);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .mechanism {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--light-gray);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    max-width: 520px;
    padding-left: 16px;
    border-left: 2px solid rgba(0,113,227,0.25);
  }

  /* CTA */
  .cta-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: var(--blue);
    color: #fff;
    font-family: -apple-system, 'SF Pro Text', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: 980px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.15s;
    width: fit-content;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: #0077ed; }
  .cta-sub {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--light-gray);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  /* STAT STRIP */
  .stat-strip {
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding: 36px 32px;
    background: #fff;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    gap: 48px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .stat-num {
    font-family: -apple-system, 'SF Pro Display', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--graphite);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }
  .stat-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--mid-gray);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    nav { padding: 0 20px; }
    .hero { padding: 48px 20px 48px; }
    .stat-strip { padding: 28px 20px; gap: 28px; }
    .stat-num { font-size: 24px; }
  }
</style>
